    <data key="d0">MusicMatch Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=some_youtube_link</data>
    <data key="d2">MusicMatch's architecture focuses on real-time content synchronization and user feedback processing. It leverages AWS AppSync for real-time data, DynamoDB for task management, and integrates with a legacy EC2 system. Fargate, RedShift, and Lambda are used for background content processing, analytics, and task orchestration, enhancing the user's music experience with synchronized lyrics and translations.</data>
    <data key="d3">Media &amp; Entertainment,Data Analytics,Serverless</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
